course: dictionary
lesson: 11600
title: Append: adding to the end
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: To append something is to add it to the end of a piece of writing or a list. It is a formal word, so you will often meet it in letters, reports and forms. «Please append a copy of your ticket to the form.» The ticket goes on the end, after everything else.
explain: Computers use the word too. When a coder appends an item to a list, the new item goes at the very end, after all the items already there. «The program appends the name Sam to the list.» Sam does not go at the start. He joins the end.
explain: Look for clue words such as end, after, add and list. A good check is to swap in "add to the end" and see if the sentence still makes sense. Two phrases to notice are append to, as in "append a note to the letter", and appended list, which means a list added on the end of something.
fact: Append means to add something to the end.
fact: «Append» is a formal word, often used in documents and reports.
fact: In computing, to append an item to a list means to add it after the last item.
fact: «Appended» is the past tense: «She appended a list of sources.»
fact: Clue words for append are end, after, add and list.
exercise: «Please append your name to the end of the list.» What does append mean here? | To read the list out loud | To remove from the top | *To add to the end | To draw a picture of the list
exercise: «The writer appended a list of sources at the back of the report.» Where did the list go? | At the front, before the title | In the middle of the first page | *At the back, at the end | Nowhere, it was deleted
exercise: «The program appends the name Sam to the list.» Find and copy the one word that means add to the end. | program | name | *appends | Sam
test: In a coding lesson, the teacher says, «Append the number 7 to the list.» Where does the 7 go? | At the very start of the list | Somewhere in the middle of the list | Into a different file | *At the end of the list
test: Ella writes, «I appended a note to my letter.» What did Ella do? | She removed the note from her letter | She tore up the letter | She read the letter to her friend | *She added a note to the end of her letter
exam: Which word means the same as add to the end? | *Append | Ignore | Sort | Delete
